\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, dismiss us with Thy blessing,
\par Fill our hearts with joy and peace;
\par Let us each, Thy love possessing,
\par Triumph in redeeming grace;
\par O refresh us,
\par Travelling through this wilderness.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thanks we give, and adoration,
\par For Thy gospel's joyful sound;
\par May the fruiits of Thy salvation
\par In our hearts and lives abound,
\par May Thy presence
\par With us evermore be found.
\par                         Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

